# NOTICE — Tune

Tune is reworked by **exodi_dio** and licensed under GPLv3 (see LICENSE).

## Provenance

- Application base: the Android/KMP mobile app from
  `misa198/airmedy` (GPLv3). All PC/desktop sync and previous-developer
  references have been removed; the player, library, and UI were reworked
  into a standalone local music player.
- Artist-screen UI elements and transitions adapted from
  `kushagrasinghx/BitChord` (GPLv3).

## Third-party components (from upstream)

- FFmpeg (LGPL-2.1+) — audio decoding.
- miniaudio, SFBAudioEngine references (desktop legacy, not shipped).
- OpenCC (Apache-2.0), go-pinyin phrase data (MIT), koreanromanizer (MIT)
  — romanization data/tooling where retained.
